{"id":"forecast-01","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-01/audio-2.mp3","model":"small","duration":359.28,"segments":[{"start":0.11,"end":1.09,"text":"Part 2","words":[["Part",0.11,0.63],["2",0.63,1.09]]},{"start":1.93,"end":7.63,"text":"You will hear a guide talking to a group of tourists who are going to spend a day on an island.","words":[["You",1.93,2.47],["will",2.47,2.65],["hear",2.65,2.85],["a",2.85,3.01],["guide",3.01,3.45],["talking",3.45,4.09],["to",4.09,4.35],["a",4.35,4.53],["group",4.53,4.69],["of",4.69,4.89],["tourists",4.89,5.43],["who",5.43,5.69],["are",5.69,5.79],["going",5.79,5.97],["to",5.97,6.15],["spend",6.15,6.37],["a",6.37,6.61],["day",6.61,6.83],["on",6.83,7.17],["an",7.17,7.29],["island.",7.29,7.63]]},{"start":8.85,"end":12.57,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 11 to 14.","words":[["First",8.85,9.39],["you",9.39,9.63],["have",9.63,9.79],["some",9.79,9.99],["time",9.99,10.39],["to",10.39,10.63],["look",10.63,10.77],["at",10.77,10.89],["questions",10.89,11.19],["11",11.19,11.81],["to",11.81,12.07],["14.",12.07,12.57]]},{"start":33.02,"end":36.92,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 14.","words":[["Now",33.02,33.48],["listen",33.48,33.84],["carefully",33.84,34.32],["and",34.32,34.7],["answer",34.7,35.12],["questions",35.12,35.56],["11",35.56,36.2],["to",36.2,36.44],["14.",36.44,36.92]]},{"start":40.67,"end":43.15,"text":"Well morning everyone, welcome to Palm Island.","words":[["Well",40.67,41.21],["morning",41.21,41.51],["everyone,",41.51,41.91],["welcome",42.07,42.31],["to",42.31,42.55],["Palm",42.55,42.77],["Island.",42.77,43.15]]},{"start":43.81,"end":46.11,"text":"First I'll run through the plan for the day.","words":[["First",43.81,44.19],["I'll",44.19,44.57],["run",44.57,44.75],["through",44.75,44.97],["the",44.97,45.13],["plan",45.13,45.45],["for",45.45,45.71],["the",45.71,45.81],["day.",45.81,46.11]]},{"start":46.79,"end":50.89,"text":"So the idea is that in the morning you'll go for a walk.","words":[["So",46.79,47.19],["the",47.19,48.49],["idea",48.49,48.97],["is",48.97,49.25],["that",49.25,49.43],["in",49.43,49.63],["the",49.63,49.71],["morning",49.71,49.95],["you'll",49.95,50.23],["go",50.23,50.35],["for",50.35,50.55],["a",50.55,50.67],["walk.",50.67,50.89]]},{"start":50.89,"end":55.89,"text":"There are actually a number of different walks on the island so I'll describe","words":[["There",50.89,51.61],["are",51.61,51.89],["actually",51.89,52.33],["a",52.33,52.77],["number",52.77,53.15],["of",53.15,53.43],["different",53.43,53.71],["walks",53.71,54.05],["on",54.05,54.25],["the",54.25,54.37],["island",54.37,54.61],["so",54.61,55.31],["I'll",55.31,55.61],["describe",55.61,55.89]]},{"start":55.89,"end":63.27,"text":"each one and then you can choose. So there's the boundary walk. This is one of","words":[["each",55.89,56.29],["one",56.29,56.55],["and",56.55,56.95],["then",56.95,57.17],["you",57.17,57.41],["can",57.41,57.59],["choose.",57.59,57.89],["So",58.95,59.59],["there's",59.59,60.25],["the",60.25,60.95],["boundary",60.95,61.47],["walk.",61.47,61.85],["This",62.45,62.77],["is",62.77,62.95],["one",62.95,63.15],["of",63.15,63.27]]},{"start":63.27,"end":67.15,"text":"the longer walks and it will appeal especially to people who love the coastline","words":[["the",63.27,63.37],["longer",63.37,63.65],["walks",63.65,63.99],["and",63.99,64.31],["it",64.31,64.43],["will",64.43,64.55],["appeal",64.55,64.83],["especially",64.83,65.29],["to",65.29,65.69],["people",65.69,65.93],["who",65.93,66.15],["love",66.15,66.37],["the",66.37,66.57],["coastline",66.57,67.15]]},{"start":67.15,"end":72.09,"text":"and in fact the tide is out today so it'll be perfect for exploring the","words":[["and",67.15,67.95],["in",67.95,68.15],["fact",68.15,68.47],["the",68.47,68.75],["tide",68.75,69.01],["is",69.01,69.19],["out",69.19,69.35],["today",69.35,69.61],["so",69.61,69.87],["it'll",69.87,70.21],["be",70.21,70.35],["perfect",70.35,70.87],["for",70.87,71.33],["exploring",71.33,71.91],["the",71.91,72.09]]},{"start":72.09,"end":78.83,"text":"very old rock formations behind the beach. A good option is the loop track. Now","words":[["very",72.09,72.29],["old",72.29,72.65],["rock",72.65,72.99],["formations",72.99,73.57],["behind",73.57,74.07],["the",74.07,74.41],["beach.",74.41,74.73],["A",75.49,76.03],["good",76.03,76.21],["option",76.21,76.67],["is",76.67,77.05],["the",77.05,77.25],["loop",77.25,77.49],["track.",77.49,77.87],["Now",78.45,78.83]]},{"start":78.83,"end":83.29,"text":"While this is quite short but don't be misled by that because it's very hilly and you","words":[["While",78.83,78.91],["this",78.91,79.05],["is",79.05,79.23],["quite",79.23,79.47],["short",79.47,79.87],["but",79.87,80.19],["don't",80.19,80.51],["be",80.51,80.63],["misled",80.63,81.01],["by",81.01,81.31],["that",81.31,81.51],["because",81.51,81.77],["it's",81.77,82.01],["very",82.01,82.23],["hilly",82.23,82.61],["and",82.61,83.07],["you",83.07,83.29]]},{"start":83.29,"end":84.31,"text":"need to be quite fit.","words":[["need",83.29,83.45],["to",83.45,83.59],["be",83.59,83.71],["quite",83.71,84.01],["fit.",84.01,84.31]]},{"start":85.17,"end":89.91,"text":"The reward though is that you'll be able to see right down the length of the island","words":[["The",85.17,85.73],["reward",85.73,86.15],["though",86.15,86.43],["is",86.43,86.83],["that",86.83,87.01],["you'll",87.01,87.27],["be",87.27,87.41],["able",87.41,87.63],["to",87.63,87.81],["see",87.81,88.05],["right",88.05,88.43],["down",88.43,88.89],["the",88.89,89.07],["length",89.07,89.29],["of",89.29,89.47],["the",89.47,89.59],["island",89.59,89.91]]},{"start":89.91,"end":91.67,"text":"and even across to the mainland.","words":[["and",89.91,90.41],["even",90.41,90.73],["across",90.73,91.01],["to",91.01,91.25],["the",91.25,91.35],["mainland.",91.35,91.67]]},{"start":92.55,"end":95.45,"text":"It'll be pretty as a picture on a fine day like today.","words":[["It'll",92.55,92.85],["be",92.85,92.99],["pretty",92.99,93.35],["as",93.35,93.59],["a",93.59,93.73],["picture",93.73,94.03],["on",94.03,94.49],["a",94.49,94.61],["fine",94.61,94.77],["day",94.77,94.97],["like",94.97,95.15],["today.",95.15,95.45]]},{"start":96.33,"end":101.09,"text":"There's the Puriri Walk which follows one of the earliest trails that was built","words":[["There's",96.33,96.87],["the",96.87,97.01],["Puriri",97.01,97.49],["Walk",97.49,97.87],["which",97.87,98.57],["follows",98.57,99.01],["one",99.01,99.29],["of",99.29,99.41],["the",99.41,99.57],["earliest",99.57,99.95],["trails",99.95,100.43],["that",100.43,100.73],["was",100.73,100.87],["built",100.87,101.09]]},{"start":101.09,"end":101.71,"text":"on the island.","words":[["on",101.09,101.29],["the",101.29,101.41],["island.",101.41,101.71]]},{"start":102.61,"end":106.83,"text":"Unfortunately the track's been damaged slightly by a storm but it's still passable.","words":[["Unfortunately",102.61,103.17],["the",103.17,103.53],["track's",103.53,103.91],["been",103.91,104.05],["damaged",104.05,104.47],["slightly",104.47,105.01],["by",105.01,105.29],["a",105.29,105.45],["storm",105.45,105.67],["but",105.67,105.89],["it's",105.89,106.11],["still",106.11,106.31],["passable.",106.31,106.83]]},{"start":107.45,"end":113.73,"text":"The nice thing is, about half way there's a table and chairs. They've recently been","words":[["The",107.45,107.97],["nice",107.97,108.25],["thing",108.25,108.49],["is,",108.49,108.89],["about",109.09,109.77],["half",109.77,110.47],["way",110.47,110.77],["there's",110.77,111.07],["a",111.07,111.15],["table",111.15,111.51],["and",111.51,111.73],["chairs.",111.73,112.05],["They've",112.69,113.09],["recently",113.09,113.39],["been",113.39,113.73]]},{"start":113.73,"end":118.75,"text":"restored and painted in fact, and it's a great place to eat your packed lunch and have a rest.","words":[["restored",113.73,114.15],["and",114.15,114.51],["painted",114.51,114.89],["in",114.89,115.07],["fact,",115.07,115.35],["and",115.81,116.19],["it's",116.19,116.39],["a",116.39,116.47],["great",116.47,116.65],["place",116.65,116.91],["to",116.91,117.11],["eat",117.11,117.25],["your",117.25,117.43],["packed",117.43,117.61],["lunch",117.61,117.97],["and",117.97,118.19],["have",118.19,118.39],["a",118.39,118.53],["rest.",118.53,118.75]]},{"start":119.69,"end":125.73,"text":"You could also walk up to North Head. This is an inland walk. You'll hardly get a glimpse","words":[["You",119.69,120.13],["could",120.13,120.27],["also",120.27,120.53],["walk",120.53,120.75],["up",120.75,120.95],["to",120.95,121.13],["North",121.13,121.35],["Head.",121.35,121.65],["This",122.33,122.59],["is",122.59,122.75],["an",122.75,122.93],["inland",122.93,123.29],["walk.",123.29,123.69],["You'll",124.43,124.77],["hardly",124.77,125.23],["get",125.23,125.45],["a",125.45,125.57],["glimpse",125.57,125.73]]},{"start":125.73,"end":130.47,"text":"of the sea the whole way, but the attraction is you'll pass through a large area of very","words":[["of",125.73,125.95],["the",125.95,126.15],["sea",126.15,126.29],["the",126.29,126.43],["whole",126.43,126.65],["way,",126.65,126.99],["but",127.13,127.33],["the",127.33,127.49],["attraction",127.49,127.89],["is",127.89,128.31],["you'll",128.31,128.57],["pass",128.57,128.81],["through",128.81,129.13],["a",129.13,129.31],["large",129.31,129.63],["area",129.63,130.03],["of",130.03,130.23],["very",130.23,130.47]]},{"start":130.47,"end":137.81,"text":"old native bush. The number of birds is amazing, including several rare species. You'll find","words":[["old",130.47,130.75],["native",130.75,131.17],["bush.",131.17,131.57],["The",132.47,132.63],["number",132.63,132.91],["of",132.91,133.09],["birds",133.09,133.41],["is",133.41,133.61],["amazing,",133.61,134.09],["including",134.09,134.67],["several",134.67,135.15],["rare",135.15,135.49],["species.",135.49,135.93],["You'll",137.03,137.45],["find",137.45,137.81]]},{"start":137.81,"end":141.09,"text":"some are quite tame, but please don't give them any food.","words":[["some",137.81,138.21],["are",138.21,138.43],["quite",138.43,138.69],["tame,",138.69,139.11],["but",139.33,139.55],["please",139.55,139.93],["don't",139.93,140.25],["give",140.25,140.41],["them",140.41,140.59],["any",140.59,140.75],["food.",140.75,141.09]]},{"start":144.66,"end":150.42,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at questions 15 to 20.","words":[["Before",144.66,145.0],["you",145.0,145.28],["hear",145.28,145.56],["the",145.56,145.74],["rest",145.74,146.0],["of",146.0,146.12],["the",146.12,146.2],["talk,",146.2,146.52],["you",146.98,147.16],["have",147.16,147.38],["some",147.38,147.56],["time",147.56,148.0],["to",148.0,148.28],["look",148.28,148.4],["at",148.4,148.56],["questions",148.56,148.9],["15",148.9,149.78],["to",149.78,150.02],["20.",150.02,150.42]]},{"start":180.94,"end":184.36,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 15 to 20.","words":[["Now",180.94,181.22],["listen",181.22,181.56],["and",181.56,181.9],["answer",181.9,182.34],["questions",182.34,182.8],["15",182.8,183.72],["to",183.72,183.96],["20.",183.96,184.36]]},{"start":187.66,"end":192.44,"text":"OK. Well, after your walk, the bus will take you to the regional park where you can relax","words":[["OK.",187.66,188.22],["Well,",188.6,188.84],["after",189.0,189.28],["your",189.28,189.48],["walk,",189.48,189.76],["the",189.92,189.98],["bus",189.98,190.18],["will",190.18,190.38],["take",190.38,190.56],["you",190.56,190.7],["to",190.7,190.8],["the",190.8,190.92],["regional",190.92,191.18],["park",191.18,191.56],["where",191.56,191.86],["you",191.86,191.98],["can",191.98,192.12],["relax",192.12,192.44]]},{"start":192.44,"end":197.72,"text":"for a couple of hours before going home. Now, if you look at your maps of the regional park,","words":[["for",192.44,192.64],["a",192.64,192.74],["couple",192.74,192.9],["of",192.9,193.02],["hours",193.02,193.26],["before",193.26,193.52],["going",193.52,193.86],["home.",193.86,194.22],["Now,",195.08,195.32],["if",195.52,195.72],["you",195.72,195.84],["look",195.84,195.98],["at",195.98,196.12],["your",196.12,196.22],["maps",196.22,196.5],["of",196.5,196.7],["the",196.7,196.84],["regional",196.84,197.22],["park,",197.22,197.72]]},{"start":198.16,"end":205.2,"text":"I'll just describe a few things you can do. So, the bus will drop you at the park entrance right","words":[["I'll",198.16,198.46],["just",198.46,198.76],["describe",198.76,199.16],["a",199.16,199.36],["few",199.36,199.5],["things",199.5,199.76],["you",199.76,199.94],["can",199.94,200.1],["do.",200.1,200.36],["So,",202.02,202.46],["the",202.72,202.84],["bus",202.84,203.06],["will",203.06,203.22],["drop",203.22,203.48],["you",203.48,203.66],["at",203.66,203.78],["the",203.78,203.9],["park",203.9,204.2],["entrance",204.2,204.7],["right",204.7,205.2]]},{"start":205.2,"end":211.44,"text":"at the bottom of the map. One interesting place is the bird colony. To get there from the park","words":[["at",205.2,205.38],["the",205.38,205.44],["bottom",205.44,205.66],["of",205.66,205.86],["the",205.86,205.96],["map.",205.96,206.22],["One",206.98,207.42],["interesting",207.42,207.94],["place",207.94,208.3],["is",208.3,208.7],["the",208.7,208.86],["bird",208.86,209.06],["colony.",209.06,209.48],["To",210.32,210.52],["get",210.52,210.66],["there",210.66,210.86],["from",210.86,211.06],["the",211.06,211.22],["park",211.22,211.44]]},{"start":211.44,"end":217.24,"text":"entrance, you go up the path to the lake. About halfway round the east side of the lake,","words":[["entrance,",211.44,211.86],["you",212.14,212.22],["go",212.22,212.38],["up",212.38,212.7],["the",212.7,212.82],["path",212.82,213.12],["to",213.12,213.34],["the",213.34,213.44],["lake.",213.44,213.72],["About",214.42,214.8],["halfway",214.8,215.44],["round",215.44,215.92],["the",215.92,216.1],["east",216.1,216.4],["side",216.4,216.74],["of",216.74,216.88],["the",216.88,216.98],["lake,",216.98,217.24]]},{"start":217.24,"end":220.98,"text":"you need to turn off and take the path all the way out to the coast.","words":[["you",217.24,217.56],["need",217.56,217.72],["to",217.72,217.88],["turn",217.88,218.12],["off",218.12,218.42],["and",218.42,218.68],["take",218.68,218.98],["the",218.98,219.16],["path",219.16,219.46],["all",219.46,219.84],["the",219.84,220.0],["way",220.0,220.18],["out",220.18,220.42],["to",220.42,220.6],["the",220.6,220.66],["coast.",220.66,220.98]]},{"start":221.56,"end":224.86,"text":"You'll find the colony there, overlooking a little island.","words":[["You'll",221.56,221.96],["find",221.96,222.24],["the",222.24,222.42],["colony",222.42,222.76],["there,",222.76,223.14],["overlooking",223.5,224.1],["a",224.1,224.3],["little",224.3,224.42],["island.",224.42,224.86]]},{"start":226.06,"end":231.46,"text":"Now, if you'd like a swim, remember that not all the beaches are really suitable in this wind.","words":[["Now,",226.06,226.38],["if",226.6,226.82],["you'd",226.82,227.04],["like",227.04,227.18],["a",227.18,227.36],["swim,",227.36,227.72],["remember",228.24,228.54],["that",228.54,228.86],["not",228.86,229.04],["all",229.04,229.42],["the",229.42,229.58],["beaches",229.58,229.78],["are",229.78,230.04],["really",230.04,230.26],["suitable",230.26,230.6],["in",230.6,231.0],["this",231.0,231.22],["wind.",231.22,231.46]]},{"start":232.36,"end":236.1,"text":"For the safest place, follow the path north from the park entrance,","words":[["For",232.36,232.82],["the",232.82,232.96],["safest",232.96,233.34],["place,",233.34,233.76],["follow",233.98,234.18],["the",234.18,234.38],["path",234.38,234.62],["north",234.62,235.0],["from",235.0,235.3],["the",235.3,235.44],["park",235.44,235.64],["entrance,",235.64,236.1]]},{"start":236.5,"end":240.2,"text":"but before you get to the lake, turn right and go down there to the beach.","words":[["but",236.5,236.72],["before",236.72,236.98],["you",236.98,237.16],["get",237.16,237.32],["to",237.32,237.46],["the",237.46,237.56],["lake,",237.56,237.82],["turn",238.02,238.26],["right",238.26,238.56],["and",238.56,238.94],["go",238.94,239.16],["down",239.16,239.4],["there",239.4,239.68],["to",239.68,239.82],["the",239.82,239.92],["beach.",239.92,240.2]]},{"start":241.66,"end":244.7,"text":"Something that people find interesting is the old ship.","words":[["Something",241.66,242.18],["that",242.18,242.58],["people",242.58,242.86],["find",242.86,243.14],["interesting",243.14,243.66],["is",243.66,243.88],["the",243.88,244.04],["old",244.04,244.34],["ship.",244.34,244.7]]},{"start":244.7,"end":250.48,"text":"ship. It's more than a hundred years old. To get there, just north of the park entrance,","words":[["ship.",244.7,244.8],["It's",245.26,245.58],["more",245.58,245.76],["than",245.76,245.92],["a",245.92,246.06],["hundred",246.06,246.32],["years",246.32,246.62],["old.",246.62,246.92],["To",247.74,247.98],["get",247.98,248.14],["there,",248.14,248.6],["just",248.78,249.02],["north",249.02,249.46],["of",249.46,249.7],["the",249.7,249.82],["park",249.82,250.04],["entrance,",250.04,250.48]]},{"start":250.74,"end":256.18,"text":"you take the path which heads towards Okiwi Bay. Then walk along the coast a little way","words":[["you",250.74,250.8],["take",250.8,251.02],["the",251.02,251.22],["path",251.22,251.5],["which",251.5,251.76],["heads",251.76,252.08],["towards",252.08,252.46],["Okiwi",252.46,253.18],["Bay.",253.18,253.4],["Then",254.22,254.6],["walk",254.6,254.86],["along",254.86,255.1],["the",255.1,255.32],["coast",255.32,255.56],["a",255.56,255.78],["little",255.78,255.88],["way",255.88,256.18]]},{"start":256.18,"end":261.66,"text":"before turning right and following that path over to Rocky Bay. You'll see the wharf,","words":[["before",256.18,256.46],["turning",256.46,256.86],["right",256.86,257.2],["and",257.2,257.68],["following",257.68,257.98],["that",257.98,258.28],["path",258.28,258.64],["over",258.64,258.98],["to",258.98,259.2],["Rocky",259.2,259.48],["Bay.",259.48,259.8],["You'll",260.5,261.04],["see",261.04,261.22],["the",261.22,261.36],["wharf,",261.36,261.66]]},{"start":262.06,"end":268.46,"text":"go past that and the ship is just along there. A long walk but one that's well worth it","words":[["go",262.06,262.16],["past",262.16,262.52],["that",262.52,262.88],["and",262.88,263.4],["the",263.4,263.52],["ship",263.52,263.72],["is",263.72,263.88],["just",263.88,264.16],["along",264.16,264.48],["there.",264.48,264.82],["A",265.72,266.12],["long",266.12,266.46],["walk",266.46,266.8],["but",266.8,267.14],["one",267.14,267.38],["that's",267.38,267.64],["well",267.64,267.9],["worth",267.9,268.22],["it",268.22,268.46]]},{"start":268.46,"end":274.34,"text":"is up to Stony Batter. You follow the path right around the lake to the far side and","words":[["is",268.46,268.76],["up",268.76,269.04],["to",269.04,269.2],["Stony",269.2,269.6],["Batter.",269.6,269.92],["You",270.4,270.84],["follow",270.84,271.1],["the",271.1,271.26],["path",271.26,271.56],["right",271.56,271.96],["around",271.96,272.36],["the",272.36,272.56],["lake",272.56,272.82],["to",272.82,273.02],["the",273.02,273.16],["far",273.16,273.38],["side",273.38,273.72],["and",273.72,274.34]]},{"start":274.34,"end":280.88,"text":"keep heading north. But if you reach the water tower you've gone too far. Before that, you","words":[["keep",274.34,274.56],["heading",274.56,274.96],["north.",274.96,275.32],["But",276.2,276.54],["if",276.54,276.94],["you",276.94,277.06],["reach",277.06,277.3],["the",277.3,277.46],["water",277.46,277.7],["tower",277.7,278.08],["you've",278.08,278.34],["gone",278.34,278.52],["too",278.52,278.76],["far.",278.76,279.08],["Before",279.98,280.24],["that,",280.24,280.54],["you",280.74,280.88]]},{"start":280.88,"end":283.84,"text":"want to turn off to your left and take the path to the coast.","words":[["want",280.88,281.04],["to",281.04,281.18],["turn",281.18,281.38],["off",281.38,281.62],["to",281.62,281.8],["your",281.8,281.92],["left",281.92,282.18],["and",282.18,282.5],["take",282.5,282.74],["the",282.74,282.9],["path",282.9,283.2],["to",283.2,283.4],["the",283.4,283.54],["coast.",283.54,283.84]]},{"start":285.0,"end":293.44,"text":"Now where else is there? Oh yes, the Settler's Monument. That's popular. So from the park","words":[["Now",285.0,285.56],["where",285.56,286.12],["else",286.12,286.44],["is",286.44,286.58],["there?",286.58,286.86],["Oh",287.94,287.94],["yes,",287.94,288.68],["the",289.14,289.22],["Settler's",289.22,289.94],["Monument.",289.94,290.34],["That's",290.72,291.0],["popular.",291.0,291.26],["So",292.0,292.48],["from",292.48,293.02],["the",293.02,293.16],["park",293.16,293.44]]},{"start":293.44,"end":299.24,"text":"entrance take the first path on the left and follow it around behind Akiwi Bay. The monument","words":[["entrance",293.44,293.82],["take",293.82,294.36],["the",294.36,294.58],["first",294.58,294.84],["path",294.84,295.18],["on",295.18,295.36],["the",295.36,295.46],["left",295.46,295.7],["and",295.7,296.04],["follow",296.04,296.36],["it",296.36,296.54],["around",296.54,296.86],["behind",296.86,297.34],["Akiwi",297.34,297.86],["Bay.",297.86,298.08],["The",298.66,298.94],["monument",298.94,299.24]]},{"start":299.24,"end":302.06,"text":"is out at the end there on the headland.","words":[["is",299.24,299.66],["out",299.66,299.96],["at",299.96,300.18],["the",300.18,300.3],["end",300.3,300.66],["there",300.66,300.9],["on",300.9,301.2],["the",301.2,301.44],["headland.",301.44,302.06]]},{"start":302.86,"end":305.88,"text":"Finally, if all this exercise has made you thirsty,","words":[["Finally,",302.86,303.44],["if",303.74,303.9],["all",303.9,304.16],["this",304.16,304.36],["exercise",304.36,304.86],["has",304.86,305.16],["made",305.16,305.36],["you",305.36,305.54],["thirsty,",305.54,305.88]]},{"start":306.16,"end":309.46,"text":"there's a kiosk where you can get hot and cold drinks.","words":[["there's",306.16,306.38],["a",306.38,306.4],["kiosk",306.4,307.04],["where",307.04,307.48],["you",307.48,307.64],["can",307.64,307.82],["get",307.82,307.98],["hot",307.98,308.34],["and",308.34,308.7],["cold",308.7,309.02],["drinks.",309.02,309.46]]},{"start":310.1,"end":312.24,"text":"It's easy to find beside the lake,","words":[["It's",310.1,310.64],["easy",310.64,310.86],["to",310.86,311.0],["find",311.0,311.3],["beside",311.3,311.68],["the",311.68,311.98],["lake,",311.98,312.24]]},{"start":312.48,"end":313.72,"text":"right on the water's edge.","words":[["right",312.48,312.84],["on",312.84,313.16],["the",313.16,313.24],["water's",313.24,313.54],["edge.",313.54,313.72]]},{"start":314.72,"end":317.4,"text":"Well now, if anyone has any questions.","words":[["Well",314.72,315.02],["now,",315.02,315.44],["if",315.8,316.02],["anyone",316.02,316.42],["has",316.42,316.72],["any",316.72,316.88],["questions.",316.88,317.4]]},{"start":321.89,"end":323.83,"text":"That is the end of part two.","words":[["That",321.89,322.35],["is",322.35,322.51],["the",322.51,322.67],["end",322.67,323.03],["of",323.03,323.21],["part",323.21,323.41],["two.",323.41,323.83]]},{"start":324.49,"end":328.39,"text":"You now have 30 seconds to check your answers to part two.","words":[["You",324.49,324.75],["now",324.75,325.03],["have",325.03,325.39],["30",325.39,325.79],["seconds",325.79,326.33],["to",326.33,326.63],["check",326.63,326.93],["your",326.93,327.13],["answers",327.13,327.57],["to",327.57,327.81],["part",327.81,328.01],["two.",328.01,328.39]]}]}